            {
                id ergo.orm-bridge
                title "Design: the typed bridge from CTE/LATERAL/window/union statements into ORM decode"
                log (
                    {
                        at 2026-09-03T20:17:03.719503Z
                        author "brendan@necessary.nu"
                        kind @decision
                        text "Probe verdict: the problem is not one problem. LATERAL, WINDOW, and UNION/INTERSECT/EXCEPT mutate SelectStatement in place — typed decode never breaks, they are reachable today via QuerySelect::query(), and need only named ORM combinators. Only WITH is a real gap: SelectStatement::with() consumes into WithQuery, which is inert (pub(crate) fields, no Selector entry, no LIMIT/filter ever again). Design: carry with: Option<AnyWithClause> ON SelectStatement in pgorm-query, rendered as an unconditional prefix (live-PG-verified legal in every nesting position); Selector/SelectorRaw/Paginator/Cursor then inherit CTE support with zero changes; ORM grows QuerySelect default methods (with_cte, with_recursive_cte, join_lateral, window, union). Also close G1/G2: Selector::from_select::<M>(SelectStatement) and SelectorRaw::into_tuple (G2 is the prerequisite ergo.pipeline-api's SQL output lands on). Rejected with probe evidence: widening Selector to impl QueryStatementBuilder (admits write statements into SELECT decode; loses one()'s limit-1 — proven live, SelectorRaw::one() is a RowCount protocol error); TypedStatement<M>(Box<dyn ...>) (renderable but never nestable — into_sub_query_statement cannot move through the object). Found hazard for its own rule: recursive CTE anchor-arm types resolve untyped $n to text (live failures E42883/E22021); only cast_as annotates the placeholder. Eight rules drafted in the agent report. Effort 1.5-2.5 days, no breaking signatures. Probes 8/8 green; spike code archived on the node's branch, not merged."
                    }

                    {
                        at 2026-09-03T20:17:22.67587Z
                        author "brendan@necessary.nu"
                        kind @status
                        text "Todo → Done (nplan complete)"
